    .suffix = { ent-MobMouse.suffix }
ent-MobMouseCancer = 罹癌小鼠 | cancer mouse
    .desc = 有毒。吱吱聲！ | Toxic. Squeak!
    .suffix = { ent-MobMouse.suffix }
ent-MobLizard = 蜥蜴
    .desc = 一隻無害的龍。 | A harmless dragon.
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-MobSlug = slug | slug
    .desc = 他們竟然把這叫作蜥蜴？ | And they called this a lizard?
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-MobFrog = 青蛙 | frog
    .desc = 蹦蹦蹦。看起來水潤水潤的。 | Hop hop hop. Lookin' moist.
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-MobParrotBase = 鸚鵡 | parrot
    .desc = 潛入你的領域，監視你，卻不知為何依然是個很酷的寵物。 | Infiltrates your domain, spies on you, and somehow still a cool pet.
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-MobParrot = { ent-MobParrotBase }
    .desc = { ent-MobParrotBase.desc }
    .suffix = { ent-MobParrotBase.suffix }
ent-MobPenguin = 企鵝 | penguin
    .desc = 由於膝蓋深處的疼痛，他們的生活始終飽受折磨。 | Their lives are constant pain due to their inner-body knees.
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-MobGrenadePenguin = 手榴彈企鵝 | grenade penguin
    .desc = 一隻脖子上綁著手榴彈的小企鵝。由「辛迪加」從冰天雪地的破爛星球上擄來。 | A small penguin with a grenade strapped around its neck. Harvested by the Syndicate from icy shit-hole planets.
    .suffix = { ent-MobPenguin.suffix }
ent-MobSnake = 蛇 | snake
    .desc = 嘶——！牠的咬傷並無毒性。 | Hissss! Bites aren't poisonous.
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-MobSpiderBase = { ent-SimpleMobBase }
    .desc = { ent-SimpleMobBase.desc }
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-SolutionVenomSpider = { ent-SolutionWeapon }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionWeapon.desc }
ent-MobSpiderAngryBase = { ent-MobSpiderBase }
    .desc = { ent-MobSpiderBase.desc }
    .suffix = { ent-MobSpiderBase.suffix }
ent-MobGiantSpider = 狼蛛 | tarantula
    .desc = 普遍被公認為是現存最糟糕的事物。 | Widely recognized to be the literal worst thing in existence.
